{"about_the_game":"Part of what R:\\Block starts out as a Sokoban style, block pushing game that evolves into something that will push your puzzle-solving skills. The other side of the game is a platformer that involves throwing a ball to complete more complex levels as you progress. In the final game, these parts will combine to make a multi-dimensional puzzle/platformer.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere are currently over 100 Sokoban-style levels, a map that let's you pick your path through the levels, and over 10 platformer stages to complete.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1197240?t=1744996124","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1197240?t=1744996124","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1197240/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744996124","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1197240/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744996124","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"Part of what R:\\Block starts out as a Sokoban style, block pushing game that evolves into something that will push your puzzle-solving skills. The other side of the game is a platformer that involves throwing a ball to complete more complex levels as you progress. In the final game, these parts will combine to make a multi-dimensional puzzle/platformer.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere are currently over 100 Sokoban-style levels, a map that let's you pick your path through the levels, and over 10 platformer stages to complete.","developers":["Derek Lied"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1197240/header.jpg?t=17